%% Sequence Diagram for API Code Generation Platform
%% Standards-compliant Mermaid (mmd)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant SpecIngest as Specification Ingestion Interface
    participant Auth as Authentication/Authorization
    participant APIGen as API Code Generation Service
    participant Audit as Audit Logging

    Dev->>SpecIngest: POST /specifications/validate (specification)
    SpecIngest->>Auth: Validate OAuth2/JWT token & RBAC
    Auth-->>SpecIngest: Access granted/denied
    SpecIngest->>SpecIngest: Validate specification schema
    SpecIngest-->>Dev: Validation result (isValid, errors)

    Dev->>SpecIngest: POST /generate-api (specification, language, options)
    SpecIngest->>Auth: Validate OAuth2/JWT token & RBAC
    Auth-->>SpecIngest: Access granted/denied
    SpecIngest->>APIGen: Send validated spec, language, options
    APIGen->>Audit: Log code generation event
    APIGen-->>SpecIngest: codeArchiveUrl, metadata
    SpecIngest-->>Dev: codeArchiveUrl, metadata

    Dev->>Audit: GET /audit/logs
    Audit->>Auth: Validate OAuth2/JWT token & RBAC
    Auth-->>Audit: Access granted/denied
    Audit-->>Dev: logs (timestamp, action, user)
